# Where the Flask API lives. OPTIONAL — leave this file absent and the Vite dev
# server proxies /api to http://127.0.0.1:5050, the backend's default port.
#
# Set it only when the backend is somewhere else (another port, another host).
# In `npm run dev` it becomes the proxy target; in a production build it is
# baked in as the absolute API base.
#
# Do NOT point this at port 5000 on macOS — that is AirPlay Receiver, which
# answers every request with an empty 403 and the dashboard will show DEMO MODE.
VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:5050
